  "body": "See https://wicg.github.io/storage-buckets/#issue-25ffaa8c\r\n\r\nThe issue mentioned in the storage buckets spec is that we need a version of [this algorithm](https://whatpr.org/fs/110.html#dom-storagemanager-getdirectory) which works for any bucket. You'll notice if you drill down into \"obtain a local storage bottle map\" that it currently assumes the \"default\" bucket. This just means passing an additional parameter.\r\n\r\nWe do not currently have a way to go from bottle to bucket for any storage endpoint.\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @evanstade in https://github.com/whatwg/fs/pull/110#discussion_r1160766995_",
